    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest isn't enough, julian. i don't mean sleep for a few hours... i mean the kind of rest where the noise finally stops. a permanent silence. i look at the cliffs outside and the dark water below, and it's the only thing that looks peaceful. it's the only thing that looks like it could actually take the weight away forever.",
